{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/moor-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":308,"crm_id":"2354","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Moor","slug":"moor-emaar-properties-dubai-creek-harbour","display_address":"Dubai Creek Harbour","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Emaar Properties","price":1628888,"display_price":"1.628M","lattitude":25.1981802,"longitude":55.3555693,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Moor is a contemporary project by Emaar that offers cozy <strong>one, two or three-bedroom</strong> living spaces set in a picturesque park in the prestigious Dubai Creek Harbour area. Elegantly designed in the heart of international-class amenities, the building offers a convenient location, making access to Dubai's most famous attractions and beyond easy and seamless.</p><p>Moor is uniquely designed, featuring a high standard of construction, innovative architectural solutions and sophisticated, spacious interiors with luxurious finishes to appeal to connoisseurs of modern urban waterfront living.</p><p>The spacious dwellings are illuminated by natural light, adorned with balconies that open onto beautiful views of the creek and the pristine 700-meter beach, accessible just a few minutes' walk from the complex.</p><p>Moor provides a unique living experience, offering residents many opportunities for recreation, privacy, relaxation and socialization. The complex features two town squares, a private pool, a shopping center with stores and restaurants, an outdoor fitness center, an outdoor play area, community room, barbecue area and a charming lawn where residents can enjoy an active lifestyle.</p><p>Moor's convenient location provides residents with a quick commute around the city: only ten minutes sepa